<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SEPT WOOD PURCHASES RISE YR/YR - METLA.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SEPT WOOD PURCHASES RISE YR/YR - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish forest industry's raw wood purchases from private forests rose clearly in September compared to previous months and were higher year-on-year, the Finnish Forest Research Institute METLA said.</p>
<p>In its monthly review on Wednesday it said wood purchases from private forests were 4.0 million cubic metres in September, up from 1.7 million cubic metres in August and up from 3.9 million cubic metres in September 1995, it said.</p>
<p>However, total January-September wood purchases were still 42 percent down year-on-year at 17.2 million cubic metres due to the quiet summer season, METLA said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
